@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Summarise a support message
POST {{baseUrl}}/summarise
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "My order was supposed to arrive three days ago and I still haven't received it. I paid extra for expedited shipping and I'm getting really frustrated with the lack of updates."
}

### Analyse a ticket (structured output)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I was charged twice for order #8823 and the tracking hasn't updated in 6 days. I need this sorted before my card statement closes."
}

### Generate a response — no order reference (ungrounded)
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate-response
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_message": "Whats the status of my order?"
}

### Generate a response — valid customer + order pair (grounded)
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate-response
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_message": "Whats the status of my order?",
  "customer_id": "CUST-101",
  "order_id": "ORD-1001"
}

### Generate a response — same order, wrong customer (should refuse to ground)
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate-response
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_message": "Whats the status of my order?",
  "customer_id": "CUST-102",
  "order_id": "ORD-1001"
}

### Generate a response — order_id without customer_id (should 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/generate-response
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_message": "Whats the status of my order?",
  "order_id": "ORD-1001"
}
